    {
      "id": "u_3840b4b9d6968c7492304dd2_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Providers are added in the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Model Providers__TRILIUM_PH_1__ section of the AI settings, with __TRILIUM_PH_2__Add Model Provider__TRILIUM_PH_3__. Each one lists the models selected for it, which are the ones the chat offers; a provider with no models selected is not offered in the chat.",
      "sourceHash": "3840b4b9d6968c7492304dd278cb045b29b6a8eab8135e74bcffef875f8918c6",
      "context": "Providers",
      "contextHash": "996c32b35f2182a9c83815395113f92344269ebb4ab3525017c4cafaa3d1a8fd",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "プロバイダーは、AI設定の __TRILIUM_PH_0__Model Providers__TRILIUM_PH_1__ セクションで __TRILIUM_PH_2__Add Model Provider__TRILIUM_PH_3__ を使用して追加します。各プロバイダーには、チャットで提供される選択されたモデルがリスト表示されます。モデルが選択されていないプロバイダーはチャットでは提供されません。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
