    {
      "id": "u_17a1557d07d532fc71c106a9_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "For all the providers, an API key is needed. Note that this is charged separately from the subscription you might already have (e.g. Claude Pro). If that might be a problem, consider using either a subscription provider (see below) or using it externally via MCP.",
      "sourceHash": "17a1557d07d532fc71c106a98022a8f23384e63073d35acf00ec884fc82f7b37",
      "context": "Providers > Cloud providers using API keys",
      "contextHash": "2e60f6cf6c88eedf5767cd2004e72b910059ed983116341cfc33b04504162be2",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "すべてのプロバイダーでAPIキーが必要です。これらは既存のサブスクリプション（Claude Proなど）とは別個に課金されることに注意してください。もしそれが問題になる場合は、サブスクリプションプロバイダー（下記参照）を使用するか、MCPを介して外部で利用することを検討してください。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c60c7aa96668735fe0eea194_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Do note that most other LLM providers (e.g. Groq, Mistral, Together) can still be used in Trilium via the OpenAI-compatible custom endpoint (see below).",
      "sourceHash": "c60c7aa96668735fe0eea194861f1445accbd3dfd33f6a1f204acfef40070ab3",
      "context": "Providers > Cloud providers using API keys",
      "contextHash": "2e60f6cf6c88eedf5767cd2004e72b910059ed983116341cfc33b04504162be2",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "他のほとんどのLLMプロバイダー（Groq、Mistral、Togetherなど）も、OpenAI互換のカスタムエンドポイント（下記参照）を介してTriliumで使用できることに注意してください。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c5aa90af05a411b2e2df7278_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "If you are using a proxy or gateway, you can also configure the base URL, otherwise the default will be used.",
      "sourceHash": "c5aa90af05a411b2e2df7278c742646ccf4abd8e1463af0b0c65784a831f86c2",
      "context": "Providers > Cloud providers using API keys",
      "contextHash": "2e60f6cf6c88eedf5767cd2004e72b910059ed983116341cfc33b04504162be2",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "プロキシまたはゲートウェイを使用している場合はベースURLを設定することもできます。そうでない場合はデフォルトが使用されます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a79ba6e1607a3dc4d64d41b1_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "For OpenRouter, the models are billed to your OpenRouter credits, and their prices, context windows and the attachments they read come from OpenRouter's own model list:",
      "sourceHash": "a79ba6e1607a3dc4d64d41b1b37909f895fb5a084b6e22fcf97f0c2ea4de14b2",
      "context": "Providers > Cloud providers using API keys",
      "contextHash": "2e60f6cf6c88eedf5767cd2004e72b910059ed983116341cfc33b04504162be2",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "OpenRouterの場合、モデルはOpenRouterのクレジットから請求され、その価格、コンテキストウィンドウ、および読み取る添付ファイルはOpenRouter独自のモデルリストから取得されます：",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_33fddc4fbff63167de358a9f_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The __TRILIUM_PH_0__Latest__TRILIUM_PH_1__ models that can use tools are selected by default, such as __TRILIUM_PH_2__Anthropic: Claude Sonnet Latest__TRILIUM_PH_3__. OpenRouter points each of them at the newest model of its line, so the selection stays current without editing the provider.",
      "sourceHash": "33fddc4fbff63167de358a9f3710861461bbc7c4eadabc3d2797a5c3ada31139",
      "context": "Providers > Cloud providers using API keys",
      "contextHash": "2e60f6cf6c88eedf5767cd2004e72b910059ed983116341cfc33b04504162be2",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Anthropic: Claude Sonnet Latest__TRILIUM_PH_1__ のように、ツールを使用できる __TRILIUM_PH_2__Latest__TRILIUM_PH_3__ モデルがデフォルトで選択されます。OpenRouterはそれぞれをその系列の最新モデルに向けるため、プロバイダーを編集しなくても選択内容が最新の状態に保たれます。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_96ed58af62ea8f11ad8d6cd6_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Models that reason have a reasoning effort dropdown in the chat (__TRILIUM_PH_0__Low__TRILIUM_PH_1__, __TRILIUM_PH_2__Medium__TRILIUM_PH_3__ or __TRILIUM_PH_4__High__TRILIUM_PH_5__).",
      "sourceHash": "96ed58af62ea8f11ad8d6cd6178d2ac221a2b646e6b1cd77927083ddd12b0ac6",
      "context": "Providers > Cloud providers using API keys",
      "contextHash": "2e60f6cf6c88eedf5767cd2004e72b910059ed983116341cfc33b04504162be2",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "推論を行うモデルには、チャット内に推論レベルのドロップダウン（__TRILIUM_PH_0__Low__TRILIUM_PH_1__、__TRILIUM_PH_2__Medium__TRILIUM_PH_3__、または __TRILIUM_PH_4__High__TRILIUM_PH_5__）があります。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_20cc4fdae7337352710dc2d6_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Auto Router__TRILIUM_PH_1__ (__TRILIUM_PH_2__) picks a model for each message. Below each reply, the chat names the model that wrote it, which is also the case when a __TRILIUM_PH_3__Latest__TRILIUM_PH_4__ model was used.",
      "sourceHash": "20cc4fdae7337352710dc2d6ee29f21f2ab0ec16980cc7f41b6c6daaa5bb79d7",
      "context": "Providers > Cloud providers using API keys",
      "contextHash": "2e60f6cf6c88eedf5767cd2004e72b910059ed983116341cfc33b04504162be2",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__Auto Router__TRILIUM_PH_1__（__TRILIUM_PH_2__）は、メッセージごとにモデルを選択します。各返信の下部には、それを記述したモデル名が表示されます。これは __TRILIUM_PH_3__Latest__TRILIUM_PH_4__ モデルが使用された場合も同様です。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1401723dd09e7c7924de7ed2_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The cost shown below a reply is what OpenRouter billed for it, rather than an estimate from the listed prices.",
      "sourceHash": "1401723dd09e7c7924de7ed2a250db7c238d4452c183910e9260d4fa2bc21b72",
      "context": "Providers > Cloud providers using API keys",
      "contextHash": "2e60f6cf6c88eedf5767cd2004e72b910059ed983116341cfc33b04504162be2",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "返信の下部に表示される費用は、リストされている価格からの見積もりではなく、OpenRouterがその返信に対して請求した金額です。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
        "promptHash": "716065651310a44dc7b240e50ada9f3b18164cb6a2471ec2ca8dd86023f06415",
        "glossaryHash": "87275a9e032d2599a1276554b41c0fed0509e3ed6ee1594f83705051d453ee50"
      },
      "translatedAt": "2026-11-14T14:14:05.465Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "u_698ba3cc64bd059ad683736d_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Image generation models and the deferred __TRILIUM_PH_0__batch__TRILIUM_PH_1__ variants are not listed.",
      "sourceHash": "698ba3cc64bd059ad683736dfa7f86f2650cb9da43ec1cd7c1d12c1c96b6ad04",
      "context": "Providers > Cloud providers using API keys",
      "contextHash": "2e60f6cf6c88eedf5767cd2004e72b910059ed983116341cfc33b04504162be2",
      "status": "translated",
      "active": true,
      "translation": "画像生成モデルおよび遅延型の __TRILIUM_PH_0__batch__TRILIUM_PH_1__ バリアントは一覧に表示されません。",
      "conditions": {
        "model": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite",
