      "kind": "p",
      "source": "When dealing with self-hosted LLM models, depending on the training and the size of the model, the quality of the output may vary. Before __TRILIUM_PH_0__reporting issues__TRILIUM_PH_1__ regarding the quality of the output (e.g. hallucinating tool calls), consider benchmarking the response against a cloud provider (Claude Sonnet is recommended).",
